<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">- NUMANA</book>
  <para style="toc1">COL - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc2">COL - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc3">COL - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="mt1">COL - NUMANA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1" />
  <para style="s1">Itǝk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1" />Irɛ bǝn Bulus, iwaŋ ndi nǝ tanyɛmɛ yɛ Arik myi nǝ na ndum kǝ Kristi Yesɔ, tǝna rɛ bǝn Timoti izumɔr.<verse eid="COL 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2" />Igar bǝn anɛr abɛ Arik nǝ ntun yi kɔlɔsiya, abaŋ ndi ayi akpa amuŋ abǝ nyaŋ bǝn Kristi: Arik Tetɛɛ amɔr abe nǝk zhin itazhɔk bǝn sɔŋ kǝ sik.<verse eid="COL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iben yi nyɛr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3" />Kɔte mkpaŋ takɛ ta nyɛr Arik, iwaŋ ndi ayi Arik Tetɛɛ ayou Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ Kristi, ndi tatǝ ben Arik ne atu amin. <verse eid="COL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4" />Tǝ tanǝ wɔ tanyɛmɛ min nǝ miŋ kɛ zǝ Kristi Yesɔ bǝn nyɛr min ne atu anɛr abǝ zǝ Arik bɔbɔk. <verse eid="COL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5" />Ndi lɛ kǝ zub, lɛ didik kǝ men, ne kuti nyɛ bǝn abɛ zhin, izhin ne wɔ ilɛ kɛ zhɔk susun ndi ne nǝk. Fe itanyɛmɛ min bǝn nyɛr min iyi ir keŋ ndi ishur ayi min iyime, ndi ne anyak zhin neyi keke ne gbarshu. <verse eid="COL 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6" />Ilɛ didik kǝ men kǝŋe nǝ gli nǝk anu didik igli nyɛmɛ tǝna du kǝ ashak gɔŋmimi, ir keŋ ndi ne yi bǝn abɛ zhin aner abɛ kɔlɔsiya ire bɛr yiŋ ndi izhin ne wɔ lɛ kǝŋe bǝn yiŋ ndi izhin ne wɔ ilɛ kǝ ta zhɔk iye Arik ai zub te zhi kɛ iyi lɛ didik. <verse eid="COL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7" />Izhin nǝ zhi tazhɔk iyɛ Arik rɛ bǝn Abafara, ikpamɔr nǝ na ndum, waŋ ndi ayi ne na ndum kǝ kristi ne ankɔŋ adidik nǝ mblu mɔr. <verse eid="COL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8" />Nǝ yiŋɛ tǝ nɛ na bla ta nyɛr ndi Izhu Tsetser nɛ nǝk zhin.<verse eid="COL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9" />Ne yiŋɛ kɔtǝ mkpaŋ takǝ ta ben Arik ne atu min, ta nǝ men wɔ ki nɛ atu min. Ta nǝ ben Arik tǝ abe nǝk zhin izhi maa, ne mgbemgbeb bɔbɔk bǝn izhi ngɔŋ ndi Izhu maa inǝk. <verse eid="COL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10" />Fe izhin tǝ zhi tsǝn ne ankɔŋ awaŋ ndi Ŋgɔŋ awɔb tǝna na iki yiŋ ndi ne tanyɛmɛ. Izhin te na iki didik bɔbɔk, izhin tei flu ne zhi Arik. <verse eid="COL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11" />Ta ben tǝ Arik abe duŋ zhin kli mgbamgbaŋ bɔbɔk nǝ klik iyiŋ ndi irɛ ngɔŋ kǝ mgbyamgbyaŋ maa, tǝ izhin bǝ vuŋ kpa nǝ kɔte nii bǝn vuŋ susun. <verse eid="COL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12" />Tǝ bǝn nyer tǝ nǝk Tetɛɛ nyer yiŋ ndi ne duŋ zhin mla abɛ ta iki yiŋ ndi Arik ne nai anyak aneshir amaa ne kɔb kɛ laŋ. <verse eid="COL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13" />Arik ne gli ta arumɔ mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ zumimin te gli ta keke agar ikɔb kɛ Izu maa ndi anyɛru, <verse eid="COL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14" />ne atu maa ne zuk ta shur, ne yiŋɛ, nɛ ta ta zhɔk nǝ lalɛ mɔr.<verse eid="COL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ bǝn ndum maa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15" />Kristi uwa ayi kpa kɛ Arik ane yaŋ yik. Iwa ayi ivǝn mla, ne kuti ayime te she na ikiki bɔbɔk. <verse eid="COL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16" />Tǝ ne atu amaa Arik nena ikiki bɔbɔk ne gbarshu bǝn gɔŋmimi, ikiki yiŋ ndi ayige bǝn iyiŋ ndi ba yige ba, bǝn mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ izhu, angɔŋgɔŋ abɛ gli aneshir, bǝn mgbyamgbyaŋ ngɔŋ. Arik nena gɔŋ abɛm bɔbɔk ire bǝn abɔu tena yi maa. <verse eid="COL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17" />Kristi ne mǝne ayime te ikiki bɔbɔk ne zhi yime, ne atu amaa ikiki bɔbɔk neyi anenen. <verse eid="COL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18" />Iwa ayi tu kɛ kpa kǝŋe, watɔ abǝ zǝ Kristi; wa ayi tiŋ kɛ ivli kɛ kpa kǝŋe. Iwa ai ivǝn mla, ndi ne lǝgu nǝ bɛ, te wa abɛ yi ngɔŋ ne ikiki bɔbɔk iwa ayi ne kuti. <verse eid="COL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19" />Fe ne tanyɛmɛ yi Arik ivǝne bǝ baŋ kpa kɛ Arik. <verse eid="COL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20" />Nǝ atu ayi ivǝne, fe, Arik ne tanyɛmɛ te gli gɔŋmimi bɔbɔk agle anyak tu maa. Arik ne gli isik susun anyɛ me ne atu ayi azhizhi ayi Izu maa ne kpɔk kuŋkun kɛ gen te gli ikiki bɔbɔk ne gɔŋmimi bǝn gbarshu. <verse eid="COL 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21" />Ne kukub izhin ne yi shaan bǝn Arik te yi abɛ te zɔr ne na ikiki mimin min bǝn ilɛ ne susun min. <verse eid="COL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22" />Ama azizaŋa, ne iku kɛ kpa kɛ Izu maa ne mkpɔk kuŋkun kɛ gen, Arik ne duŋ ta yi akpa maa, te ta abe gli zhin, tsetser, iyaŋ ngluk, bǝn yaŋ lalɛ, ne ti maa. <verse eid="COL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23" />Ate yi ndi izhin tsi kli ne tanyɛmɛ yi susun min te kli mgbamgbaŋ ndi tanda kɛ klik, kǝr izhin bǝ zhaŋ ne shur ayi min ndi zhin ne yik ne wɔ lɛ didik kǝ men. Ayi ilɛ kɛ Arik kǝŋe te nga Bulus, me ne yi igen kɛ ilɛ kɛ Arik ndi ne du kɛ bɔbɔk ne gɔŋmimi igar bǝn kɔte ŋɔwa.<verse eid="COL 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndum kɛ Bulus ne abɛ zǝ Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24" />Azǝzaŋa me nyer ne iya muŋ ne atu min, te ne atu ayi yik iya muŋ nǝ kpa mbǝ luk shaga iki yiŋ ndi ne dǝk nǝ yik iya iyi Kristi ne atu ayi kpa maa, abǝ zǝ Kristi. <verse eid="COL 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25" />Mne yi gɛn abɛ zǝ Yesɔ ne tanyɛmɛ yi Arik, waŋ ndi ne nǝm ndum kɛ du ilɛ maa ngɔŋ, <verse eid="COL 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26" />ndi ayi iki suyir ire kukub vuŋ re na neshir ama azǝzaŋa Arik ne glii aru aneshir. <verse eid="COL 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27" />Ina nyak iyi Arik aneshir abɛ zhi iki suyir maa, adudunki bǝn inǝk ngɔŋ iki suyir iyiŋ ndi ne nai anyak aneshir bɔbɔk. iki yi suyire ayi Kristi iyi nǝ miŋ min, izhin tei yi nǝ miŋ kǝ ta gab nǝ ngɔŋ kɛ Arik. <verse eid="COL 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28" />Neme ta du lɛ kɛ Kristi ben kɔte ŋɔwa. Nǝ mgbemgbeb kɛ vuŋ asusun aneshir te gbaŋ atɔŋ tena tsar ba tǝ bɛ gli kɔte ŋɔwa anyɛ ne ti kɛ Arik iwaŋ ndi ne mla ne miŋ kɛ Kristi. <verse eid="COL 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29" />Nǝ klɛtu iyiŋɛ, Mne na ndum ne mgbyamgbyaŋ, bǝn ngɔŋ kɛ klik ndi Kristi nɛ nǝk me kɛ.<verse eid="COL 1:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1" />Nga Bulus me wɔb te izhin bǝ zhi ir keŋ ndi mzǝn gɔŋri yaŋ sɔŋ sik ne atu amin aner abɛ Ladukiya tǝ vuŋ nki aner bɔbɔk abaŋ ndi bane zhim ba. <verse eid="COL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2" />Mna amɛ tem duŋ zhin shur asusun tena yi iki zhiin ne miŋ kɛ tanyɛmɛ min, te duŋ ba abɛyi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ ne izhi ilɛ kɛ Arik men teduŋ ba abɛ zhi iki yi suyir ye Arik, watɔ, Kristi ne tu maa. <verse eid="COL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3" />Yesɔ wa ayi iki bu ankɔŋ ane nyak Mgbemgbeb kɛ iyi zhi Arik.<verse eid="COL 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4" />Mbla zhin ki yiŋɛ te kǝr nuŋ abɛ lɔmzhin ne men aŋa ayi te antam ba. <verse eid="COL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5" />Mne zhi te bam yime ne kpa kǝŋe bene bɛ zhin ba, neme M yi bǝn abɛ zhin ne wu kpa kɛ Izhu tsetser ba, fe Mna nyɛr ndi izhin tsi kli mgbamgbaŋ ne miŋ kɛ tanyɛmɛ min ne zǝ Kristi.<verse eid="COL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isɔŋ kɛ men nǝ zǝ Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6" />Fena, ndi izhin ne ta Kristi Yesɔ ndi ayi Ŋgɔŋ amɔr, izhin bǝ yi aŋkun zhiin bene bɔu. <verse eid="COL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7" />izhin bǝ zhik te flu ne miŋ kɛ Kristi, tena tsi kli ne tanyɛmɛ ne kiyiŋ ndi ne tsar zhin, tena nyer zhin tetɛk.<verse eid="COL 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8" />Tɔ zhin te kǝr ner nuŋ abɛ baŋ zhin ate ikiyi duk izhɔm ba, iyiŋ ndi ayi lǝlɛ yi aneshir iyi kǝr nyak yi gɔŋmimi inaŋ yi Kristi.<verse eid="COL 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9" />Tǝ ne miŋ kɛ Kristi ishaga bɔbɔk iye Arik ne na ne kpa kɛ neshir, <verse eid="COL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10" />fena izhin ne ta ishaga ne miŋ kɛ Kristi, iwaŋ ndi iwa ayi ti ne atu ayi klik ben mgbyamgbyaŋ. <verse eid="COL 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11" />Nǝ miŋ maa ne kɔk zhin zǝk, ne kam gɔŋ ne atu ayi na ki mimin iyi kpa kɛ lalɛ kǝŋe, bane kɔkzik iye aŋɔk ayi aneshir ba, ama ayi kɔkzik iyi zǝ Kristi, <verse eid="COL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12" />Fe ndi ne ru kpa kɛ lalɛ kǝŋe ne ku Yesɔ ne su zhin amashir tena lɛk zhin bene bɔu ne tanyɛmɛ min ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ Arik, Iwaŋ ndi ne lɛk Yesɔ ne ku.<verse eid="COL 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13" />Tǝ ne kukub izhin ne ku ne miŋ kɛ lalɛ min ne yaŋ kɔkzik ne kpa kɛ lalɛ kǝŋe, Arik ne duŋ zhin atsitsir ne min Kristi. Arik ne zuk ta shur ne lalɛ mɔr, <verse eid="COL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14" />Arik ne baŋ lalɛ mɔr agle tibɛ, Yesɔ ne baŋǝ agli tibɛ ne ku maa kɛ kpaŋ ne kuŋkun kɛ gen. <verse eid="COL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15" />Ndi ne zuk iklik ben mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ aner angɔŋgɔŋ, Yesɔ ne tsar kɛ ne ayi aneshir, te li ikum maa iyi lu ne tu kuŋkun kɛ gen.<verse eid="COL 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16" />Ndi amɛ kǝr zhin bǝ duŋ nuŋ atei zhin ambuk ne atu kili kɔ iki sɔ, kɔ igyaŋ bɛr yi tsetser, ka iyi vǝvǝn hwa, kɔ ka iyi bɛr sɔŋ sik. <verse eid="COL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17" />Iki yiŋɛ ayi izhu iyi kiki nyɛ; ilɛ didik, neme, ayige ai Kristi. <verse eid="COL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18" />Duŋ tanyɛmɛ zhin ben iwaŋ ndi atimu tedi wa azeku tena di wa ayik tena anaŋ zhin te izhin bǝ zekuu abɛ shar Arik. <verse eid="COL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19" />Ne dur ne nkɔŋ kɛ zǝ Kristi, waŋ ndi wa anǝk klik iyi mkpuŋ kpa, Yesɔ iwa ayi itu kɛ kpa ndi ai abɛ zǝ Kristi atei anyɛ teduŋ gyaŋ yi asem yaŋ tena flu ir keŋ ndi Arik mtanyemɛ ne flumɔ.<verse eid="COL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ivli yayas bǝn Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20" />Ndi izhin ne ku bǝn Kristi tena ta zhin azhɔk ne ŋɔk kɛ ishetan yi gɔŋmimi, te, ayi nii duŋ zhin na ndi aner abɛ yaŋ zǝ Arik? Anii duŋ zhin zǝ tsar mǝne: <verse eid="COL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21" />&lt;&lt;Duŋ vuŋ zhin ba! Duŋ te bubu ba! Duŋ sak ŋɔk ka!&gt;&gt;? <verse eid="COL 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22" />Waŋa ai kiki iyi na bɔbɔk ndi iyi kisha, te iyi na neshir bǝn tsar ineshir ndi te cɔk la. <verse eid="COL 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23" />Nǝ zǝ kiki iyi na yiŋɛ ai na mgbemgbeb kɛ neshir, ben ir keŋ ndi asak aner ne mgbyamgbyaŋ te abɛ zekuu abɛ shar Arik, bǝn itimu, tena nek kpa iya iyaŋ nek kinuŋ iyi tik ayi yi gɔŋmimi.<verse eid="COL 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1" />Ndi yeme, fe, Arik ne lɛk zhin ne ku bǝn Yesɔ, izhin bǝ nyak asusun amin ne kiki yi shu,amkpa ane sɔŋ Yesɔ ne ngɔŋ maa ne ŋɔk li kɛ Arik. <verse eid="COL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2" />Izhin bǝ duŋ nyak asusun min ne kiki yi gɔŋmimi ba ama izhin bǝ nyak asusun amin ne kiki iyi shu. <verse eid="COL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3" />Tǝ zhin ne ku, ivli min yi ne angus akɛ Yesɔ ne miŋ kɛ Arik. <verse eid="COL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4" />Ivli mi didik iyi Kristi, tǝ ate munoru, izhineba minyi tei na munru teyi ne miŋ kɛ ngɔŋ maa.<verse eid="COL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ivli cice bǝn yayas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5" />Ne me zhin bǝ kam asusun amin ne kiki yi gɔŋmimi, amɛ ndi iwɔb amba bǝn iwɔb alulum ben ina zumimin (bǝn nyak ayi nena kiki mimin). <verse eid="COL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6" />Nǝna kiki iyiŋɛ, mfu kɛ Arik itei inyɛ netu abɛ yaŋ zǝ lɛ maa. <verse eid="COL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7" />Ne kpaŋ kɛ kukub izhin nǝ bǝn na kiki mimin yiŋɛ ne asusun amin te tanyɛmɛ neyi. <verse eid="COL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8" />Ama azizaŋa izhin bǝ tyak kiki yiŋɛ hrie: mfu, bǝn rǝra, bǝn kyak akpa ayi. Izhin bǝ duŋ yen tuk ne bɛrɛnu min ba. <verse eid="COL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9" />Izhin bǝ duŋ timu bǝn akpa min ba, izhin ne ka men tyak kiki mimin yi na min rɛ kukub ihrie <verse eid="COL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10" />izhin ne su kpa yayas. Waŋa ayi kpa keŋ ndi Arik wa ne nakǝ ir keŋ ndi wa ayime ne kǝ. <verse eid="COL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11" />Nǝ yiŋɛ, kaaŋkaŋ nuŋ ba na yime ba bǝn awɔnǝ Yahudawa ben iwaŋ ndi bai ŋli Yahudawa ba, iwaŋ ndi ne kɔgu zǝk, bǝn iwaŋ ndi bane kɔgu zǝk ba, waŋ ndi ayi cen, bǝn iwaŋ ndi ba yi icen ba, iwaŋ ndi ayi igen ben iwaŋ ndi ba yi igen ba ne lieru, kristi wa ayi ne miŋ men bɔbɔk.<verse eid="COL 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12" />Izhin yi aneshir abɛ Arik; Ne nyɛr zhin te hria zhin te zhin bǝ yi amaa. Ne me, izhin bǝ su akpa min nkluŋklu yi lɔ susun, na ki didik, ne zi tu zhɔk, ivuŋ susun Gli. <verse eid="COL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13" />Izhin bǝ tanyɛmɛ ne akpa min tena zuk kpa min shur inuŋ ate yi ne mɔ bǝn nuŋ abɛ duŋ gliu ne susun ba. zuk zhin akpa min shur ir keŋ ndi Arik ne zuk zhin ashur. <verse eid="COL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14" />Ne naŋ iyiŋɛ bɔbɔk zhin bǝ baŋ susun kɛ nyɛr keŋ ndi ibiŋ kiki yiŋɛ bɔbɔk. <verse eid="COL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15" />Isik susun yiŋɛ ndi kristi ne nǝge ibǝ ŋub zhin ne lǝlɛ min; te ayi sik susun yiŋɛ yi Arik ne zhɔ ta biŋ ne kpa zhin. Tabǝ yi abɛ nyɛr. <verse eid="COL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16" />Izhin bǝ duŋ lɛ kɛ kristi bǝ klik ne asusun amin. Tsar zhin akpa ne zhi ti. Duk zhin asem ayi gbar Arik asak; izhin bǝ duk Arik asem te na nye ru ne asusun min. <verse eid="COL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17" />Iki yiŋ ndi izhin tei nai bɔbɔk, izhin bǝ nai ne sak kɛ Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ, ndi izhin tei nye ru ne ankɔŋ ayou Arik bǝn Tetɛɛ.<verse eid="COL 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ir keŋ ndi abǝ zǝ Yesɔ abɛ sɔŋ nɛ akpa mɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18" />Amba, izhin bǝ nǝk alulum amin atu min waŋa ayi ki yiŋ ndi abɛ zǝ Arik abɛ nai.<verse eid="COL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19" />Alulum, nyɛr zhin amba min izhin bǝ duŋ lɛ mgbamgbar bǝn abɛba ba.<verse eid="COL 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20" />Amumun, ayi ndum min kɛ abɛ zi Arik izhin bǝ nǝk atǝtɛ min ngɔŋ men, neme Arik atei nyɛr zhin.<verse eid="COL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21" />Atǝtɛ izhin bǝ duŋ cɔk susun la amumun min ba, te kǝr kpa men bǝ sik ba.<verse eid="COL 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22" />Agɛn, izhin bǝ nǝk atukɔ amin ngɔŋ men kɛ gɔŋmimi. kɔ bane ayi men ba kǝr zhin bena te abɛ gbar zhin ba; fe izhin bǝ na kɔte ni susun zhiin, izhin tei ta dǝk min bǝn Arik. <verse eid="COL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23" />Bɔbɔk iki yiŋ ndi izhin tei nai izhin bǝ nai susun zhiin, na zhin ndi izhin naa Arik ba neshir ba. <verse eid="COL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24" />Shuzhi zhin Ŋgɔŋ atei nǝk zhin idǝk min keŋ ndi ne nyak aner amaa te kristi wa ayi amkplik waŋ ndi azeu. <verse eid="COL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25" />Ankyak abɛ na zumimiŋ atei ta dǝk kɛ na zumimiŋ men, Arik atei tǝǝ kɔte ŋɔwa ŋas anenen ne ki yi na maa.<verse eid="COL 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1" />Izhineba ba atukɔ, izhin bǝ na ina didik ne gli agɛn ami. Iwa ma ubɛ zhi uyi ne Ŋgɔŋ iwaŋ ndi a naŋu ne shu.<verse eid="COL 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inǝk lɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2" />Izhin bǝ nǝk atu min ne ben Arik, te bǝn hria ayi ne ben Arik, tena nyɛr Arik. <verse eid="COL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3" />Neme izhin bǝ ben ta Arik, te Arik abɛ nǝk ta mkpaŋ didik kɛ du ilɛ maa ikɛ yaŋ zhi Kristi. Waŋa ayi iki yi duŋ myi ne jaru. <verse eid="COL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4" />Ben, ndi, M tǝ du lɛ, nǝ nkɔŋ keŋ ndi ibǝ yi anenen.<verse eid="COL 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5" />Hria zhin ayi nena min bǝn abaŋ ndi ba ne zhi Arik ba, te nazhin iki didik ne mkpaŋ kɛ yik mi. <verse eid="COL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6" />Ilɛ min bǝ yi ilɛ kɛ men bǝn kɛ rɛ, izhin bǝ zhi bla ilɛ didik bǝn aneshir bɔbɔk.<verse eid="COL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itek yi klɛ tu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7" />Izumɔr Tikikus, iwaŋ ndi ta nye ru, ana ndum didik ne nkɔŋ kɛ Ŋgɔŋ, atei bla zhin lɛ didik bɔbɔk ne atu muŋ. <verse eid="COL 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8" />waŋa iki yiŋ ndi ne duŋ me sharu bǝn abɛ zhin, te izhin bǝ zhi te bɔbɔk mɔrɔ ta kusɔŋ ndɔ te asusun amin abɛ rɛ. <verse eid="COL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9" />Atei nyɛ bǝn Anisimus, waŋ ndi ayi izu mɔr, waŋ ndi ayi ne miŋ imin. Atai bla zhin iki yiŋ ndi itsen ayaŋa.<verse eid="COL 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10" />Aristakus, waŋ ndi ayi ne jaru bǝn abɛm, a tǝk zhin, bǝn Markus, izumen anii Barnaba. (Ne ka tsa ru ndi utei tau ate nyɛ bǝn abɔu.) <verse eid="COL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11" />Joshuwa, waŋ ndi azhɔu te Yustus, a tǝk zhin. A tar abaŋa ankyak ayi Ferisawa abɛ tanyɛmɛ bǝn lɛ kɛ Arik abaŋ ndi a na ndum bǝn abɛm ndum kɛ kɔb Ŋgɔŋ kɛ Arik, ne lak me tetɛk.<verse eid="COL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12" />Itek ire bǝn Abafara, inuŋ ne miŋ min bǝn iner ne zǝ Kristi Yesɔ. A benu Arik, te Arik abɛ duŋu klɛ mgbyamgbyaŋ, te ubɛ yi ne klik ne zi Arik, ne susun me bɔbɔk ne susun kɛ Arik. <verse eid="COL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13" />M tei zhi bla ndum kɛ na maa ngɔŋ bǝn abɔu bǝn aneshir abɛ ntun yi Ladukiya, bǝn Hirafolis. <verse eid="COL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14" />Izumɔr Luka, ine na kǝka, bǝn Idimas a shar te abɛ tǝk zhine.<verse eid="COL 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15" />Mtǝk zhin amunya ne Ladukiya, kam kɔmɔ ni Nimfa bǝn abɛ zǝ Yesɔ ndi abiŋ ne kɔmaa. <verse eid="COL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16" />Ndi izhin tǝ ka tɔ cɛr yiŋɛ, izhin bǝ bla abɛ zǝ Yesɔ nǝ Ladukiya ne kǝ. Ne mkpaŋa izhin bena bla icɛr iyiŋ ndi amunya abɛ yi ne Ladukiya atei shar zhin ne kǝ. <verse eid="COL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17" />Te ka bla Akibus, &lt;&lt;Ubǝ na ndum keŋ ndi Ŋgɔŋ ne sharu ma iklɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="COL 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18" />Nga Bulus mne cɛr mplɛ kǝŋe ne ŋɔk muŋ: men tǝk zhin. Kǝr izhin bɛ ŋursuk ba tǝ nɛ kpam ne atsǝtsaŋ!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 4:18">Iki didik ye Arik bɛ yime bǝn abɛ zhin.<verse eid="COL 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4" />
</usx>